<title>SOUTH AFRICA: DataTec in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>DataTec in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African firm DataTec Ltd, which distributes communications hardware, said on Friday that it was in talks that could effect the share price of its combined units.</p>
<p>The firm cautioned shareholders to exercise caution when dealing in the stock.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
